SUMMARY:TdRR Final Thursday PM Social
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nHi! This is our tradition
 al "last Thursday" TdRR social. We moved the the TdRR Thursday night rides
  and this social closer to Lancaster City to give our morning riders an op
 portunity to join us without having to drive to far. Please RSVP so we can
  give Bierhall Brewing an approximate head count. Thank you!
